      ],
      "text": "When a spore thrall is reduced to 0 Hit Points by damage other than cold damage, they burst in an explosion of toxic green spores. All creatures in a 15-foot emanation around the spore thrall take 10d6 poison damage (DC 26 basic Fortitude save save)."
